flowchart TD
    A["当前输入：选择目标并提交转发"] --> B["Angular 当前入口"]
    B --> C["V1 入口或命名命令：`im_relay_messages`"]
    C --> D["Tauri 协议转换"]
    D --> E["Helix `Tick`"]
    E --> F["`Effect`：`storage_read`、`http_write`、`projection`"]
    F --> G["Go HTTP/WS 权威事实"]
    G --> H["当前 Persist：message、channel"]
    H --> I["V1 producer：`schemaVersion=1`"]
    I --> J["`RenderNode/v1`：message.row.v1"]
    J --> K["V1 decode / `normalizeLegacyFrame`"]
    K --> L["`ProjectionStore/SurfaceRuntime`"]
    L --> M["组件：message-ui-forward-dialog、message-ui-forward-detail、message-surface-runtime-view"]
    B -. "当前旁路：部分 Gate 直接命名 Command" .-> D
    G -. "raw event 只能触发恢复，不得重建业务 VM" .-> L
    I -. "缺少 `runtime/surfaceEpoch/causationId/directives` 完整 V2 合同" .-> K
